description         Command-line client for a free proxy list re-validated every 30 minutes
long_description    ${name} prints proxies from the Proxmint free proxy list, where every \
                    entry was checked with a real request through it within the last \
                    30 minutes. Filter by protocol (http, https, socks4, socks5), country \
                    and anonymity, sort by score, latency, uptime or last check, and print \
                    ip:port, proxy URLs or JSON. No API key or signup.

